<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.67 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.67 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction January 28 versus January 21.</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    105/82     228/173	 350/357</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.06/2.96  3.20/3.02     3.35/3.19</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.06/2.96  3.21/3.02     3.35/3.20</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.04/2.95  3.17/3.02     3.34/3.16</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   253/815    110/120     1,310/193</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    253/835    110/270     1,430/213</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 41,690 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
